              "answers": [
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>Indeed, you need to rule out some things before medications are prescribed. This child may have type I Diabetes, which results in excesses in glucose and subsequent vomiting. The high levels of ketones in the body have a sweet, fruity smell. While a simple blood test will rule this in or out, other signs include:&nbsp;\n\n\tExcessive thirst&nbsp;\n\tExcessive urination\n\tExcessive hunger.\n\tLoss of weight\n\tIrritable mood\n\tFeeling tired and weak.\n\tBlurry vision.\n\n</div>\n",
                    "tip": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": "<div>NO. You need to rule out some things before medications are prescribed. This child may have type I Diabetes, which results in excesses in glucose and subsequent vomiting. The high levels of ketones in the body have a sweet, fruity smell. While a simple blood test will rule this in or out, other signs include:&nbsp;\n\n\tExcessive thirst&nbsp;\n\tExcessive urination\n\tExcessive hunger.\n\tLoss of weight\n\tIrritable mood\n\tFeeling tired and weak.\n\tBlurry vision.\n\n</div>\n"
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Smell his breath</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Give him Pepto-Bismol</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Give him a first generation antihistamine like diphenhydramine</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Prescribe Ondansetron</div>\n"
                }
